{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "1", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Λῇς νύ τί μοι Λυκίδα Σικελὸν μέλος ἁδὺ λιγαίνειν,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "2", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἱμερόεν γλυκύθυμον ἐρωτικόν, οἷον ὁ Κύκλωψ"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "3", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἄεισεν Πολύφαμος ἐπᾳονίᾳ Γαλατείᾳ;"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "4", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κἠμοὶ συρίσδεν, Μύρσων, φίλον· ἀλλὰ τί μέλψω;"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "5", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Σκύριον ὦ Λυκίδα ζαλώμενον ἁδὺν ἔρωτα,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "6", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "λάθρια Πηλείδαο φιλάματα, λάθριον εὐνάν,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "7", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πῶς παῖς ἕσσατο φᾶρος, ὅπως δ’ ἐψεύσατο μορφὰν"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "8", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κἠν κώραισιν ὅπως Λυκομηδίσιν ἁπαλέγοισα"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "9", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἠείδη κατὰ παστὸν Ἀχιλλέα Δηϊδάμεια."}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "10", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἅρπασε τὰν Ἑλέναν πόθ’ ὁ βουκόλος, ἆγε δ’ ἐς Ἴδαν,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "11", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Οἰνώνᾳ κακὸν ἄλγος. ἐχώσατο δ’ ἁ Λακεδαίμων,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "12", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πάντα δὲ λαὸν ἄγειρεν Ἀχαϊκόν, οὐδέ τις Ἕλλην"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "13", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "οὔτε Μυκηναίων οὔτ’ Ἤλιδος οὔτε Λακώνων,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "14", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "μεῖνεν ἑὸν κατὰ δῶμα φυγὼν δύστανον Ἄρηα."}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "15", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "λάνθανε δ’ ἐν κώραις Λυκομηδίσι μοῦνος Ἀχιλλεύς,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "16", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "εἴρια δ’ ἀνθ’ ὅπλων ἐδιδάσκετο, καὶ χερὶ λευκᾷ"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "17", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "παρθενικὸν κόπον εἶχεν, ἐφαίνετο δ’ ἠΰτε κώρα·"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "18", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "καὶ γὰρ ἴσον τήναις θηλύνετο, καὶ τόσον ἄνθος"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "19", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "χιονέαις πόρφυρε παρηίσι, καὶ τὸ βάδισμα"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "20", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "παρθενικῆς ἐβάδιζε, κόμας δ’ ἐπύκαζε καλύπτρᾳ."}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "21", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "θυμὸν δ’ ἀνέρος εἶχε, καὶ ἀνέρος εἶχεν ἔρωτα·"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "22", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐξ ἀοῦς δ’ ἐπὶ νύκτα παρίζετο Δηϊδαμείᾳ,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "23", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "καὶ ποτὲ μὲν τήνας ἐφίλει χέρα, πολλάκι δ’ αὐτᾶς"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "24", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "στάμονα καλὸν ἄειρε, τὰ δαίδαλα δ’ ἄτρἰ ἐπῄνει·"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "25", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἤσθιε δ’ οὐκ ἄλλᾳ σὺν ὁμάλικι, πάντα δ’ ἐποίει"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "26", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "σπεύδων κοινὸν ἐς ὕπνον. ἔλεξέ νυ καὶ λόγον αὐτᾷ·"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "27", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἅλλαι μὲν κνώσσουσι σὺν ἀλλάλαισιν ἀδελφαί,"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "28", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "αὐτὰρ ἐγὼ μώνα, μώνα δὲ σὺ νύμφα καθεύδεις."}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "29", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "αἱ δύο παρθενικαὶ συνομάλικες, αἱ δύο καλαί·"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "30", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀλλὰ μόναι κατὰ λέκτρα καθεύδομες· ἁ δὲ πονηρὰ"}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "31", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Νυσαία δολία με κακῶς ἀπὸ σεῖο μερίσδει."}
{"urn": "bion-bucolic.epithalamium-achillis-et-deidameiae-sp", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "32", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "οὐ γὰρ ἐγὼ σέο ..."}
